<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 52,062.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 52,062.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Oct 9 totaled 52,062 bales, up from 51,792 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 270 bales issued, no decertification orders, no cancellations, and 2,097 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
